# Tasks Completed

## Organizational Unit (OU) Design

Designed and implemented an enterprise-style Organizational Unit hierarchy to support future administration, Group Policy, and delegated management.

Created the following structure:

```text
corp.lab

└── Corp
    ├── Administration
    ├── IT
    ├── HR
    ├── Finance
    ├── Engineering
    ├── Servers
    ├── Workstations
    ├── Service Accounts
    └── Groups
```

This layout mirrors common enterprise Active Directory environments and provides logical separation of users, computers, administrative objects, and service accounts.

